      "summary": "Carefully organized Rio experiences, with thoughtful adjustments for a returning traveler.",
      "fullText": "I recently traveled to Rio de Janeiro with Tworld Tours over Veterans Day weekend, and it was an incredible experience! The trip was exceptionally well-organized and packed with fun activities that made the most of our time in this vibrant city.\nAs a third-time traveler with Tworld Tours, I continue to be impressed by the thoughtful curation of trips and itineraries. What stood out the most this time was the personalized care – the organizer made last-minute adjustments to accommodate my fear of extreme heights, ensuring I still had an amazing experience without feeling pressured.\nThis level of professionalism and attention to detail keeps me coming back, and I’m already looking forward to joining another group trip soon. Highly recommend Tworld Tours to anyone seeking unforgettable travel experiences!",
