      "summary": "A welcoming first Rio trip, cultural variety, and friendships that felt immediate.",
      "fullText": "Traveling to Rio de Janeiro was my first trip with T Worlds Tours, and I can honestly say it was truly an amazing experience. The entire itinerary was well organized and planned each day and offered a really nice variety of cultural, social, and sightseeing experiences.  I also appreciated that the owner and our host, Taliya, took the time to personally vet and scope out different places onsite before the group arrived. She’s also one of the warmest and most welcoming people you’ll meet!\nOne of the most special parts of the trip for me was the people I met and the sense of community I felt from day one. Traveling to a foreign country with a group of strangers takes courage, but connecting with like-minded people who are also passionate about seeing the world and who instantly make you feel like you’re just reuniting with old friends is priceless. I’m so happy I went on the trip and look forward to my next experience with T World Tours!",
