      "fullText": "It was my first time traveling  with TWT. I didn’t know what to expect. I live in the Netherlands, so it also my first time traveling with Americans (hihihi). But i have to say i LOVED everything from the beginning  to the end!!\nAll the activities:elephant’s reserve, cooking lesson, island hopping, snorkeling, clubbing, dress codes, swimming, yacht party. I loved it all! It was the best luxury vaction. Taliya planned everything. The only thing that i hade to be worried about, was if i looked good. Nothing more: the pick-up, restaurants literally everything was planned and taking care of. And Taliya is the sweetest host, like her energy and personality.\nI give this whole experience 100/10.\nI would recommend TWT to everyone.  I made some new friends, hade fun and laughters. It didn’t matter if i was from aboard, everyone got included. I sure will go to another trip with TWT. Looking out for the 2024 planning’s.",
