      "fullText": "Where do i start? From the beginning to the end of the tour, i am in awe with this Dubai trip and how TWT  made it a great one for the books. What made the trip unique to me is how detailed everything was and how the CEO Taliya planned the tour with much thoughts and details. The tour really promised what it promoted which is experiencing traveling in a luxurious way.\nMy favorite highlight of the group was the farewell dinner and almost touching the Burj Khalifa from our Michelin star roof top dinner table. it was a site to see for sure.\nTWT differentiates itself from other group tour that i have been on in the past in that it focuses more on the luxury side of traveling and really plans everything out with great details. There is also a photographer on standby to take all your pictures so you can actually enjoy the moment\nI really enjoyed the group so much and i made life long friends on this trip and will cherish our moments together forever.  It was my first trip with her and it won't be my last. I am very impressed looking forward to going on more trips with TWT",
