      "summary": "A solo Dubai traveler appreciated thoughtful gifts, accommodations, and new friendships.",
      "fullText": "This Dubai trip was luxurious and breathtaking. Definitely a trip I will remember for a lifetime! Our host, Taliya, was so thoughtful, knowledgeable, and accommodating. She even went out of her way to provide me with an abaya and name plate chain as a gift. Although I went there solo, I made new friends. The experience with the group was full of laughs and memories that I hope I never forget. Our accommodations were amazing and centrally located in Dubai. The itinerary was strategically and impressively put together! 10/10 for sure! I’ve traveled with one other travel group company and there is no comparison. One distinction is, there’s a professional photographer on the trip!! This alone helps you fully soak it all in and not worry about getting the perfect picture, because they got you! I can’t wait for more adventures with T World Tours!",
