      "fullText": "AMAZING is the word for this trip!!!!  This was my first time booking with TWT (Zanzibar) and it DID NOT disappoint…. If you want an unforgettable experience without the hassles of booking a hotel, finding activities, or worrying about where you’re going to eat, then this is for YOU!!\nThis trip was well planned and thought out from BEGINNING to END!!!… from the pickup at the airport, welcome dinner decor, swimming with the turtles, first aid kit she kept in her bag😂, sunset dinners, coordination with her team to pick up my lost luggage 😭, and turn-ups at the club💃🏽… it was all SPECTACULAR . Taliyah did an awesome job communicating before, during and after the trip. She is professional, truly genuine, kind hearted, and welcoming!\nI could write a book about my time in Zanzibar but just know you have to experience it yourself! Come with an open mind, ready to have fun, have new experiences, and meet strangers turned FAMILY!!!!\nTHANK YOU TWT …..I am Looking forward to my next trip and creating even more memories that will last a lifetime❤️",
