      "fullText": "Zanzibar was phenomenal from start to finish. The island is beautiful, and the excursions are just as luxe and exclusive as promised, but Taliya takes hospitality far beyond anything you could expect. From coordinating and arranging the tracking down and delivery of delayed luggage, to anticipating the needs and preferences of the group, she made sure we were good at all times and snuck in beautiful surprises throughout the trip.\nWe arrived as 16 sttangers knowing at most 1-2 others and left as friends. Everyone in the group just clicked - a rarity. The TWT Zanizibar experience is Top tier.",
