      "summary": "A returning traveler explored Egypt’s monuments, desert adventures, and Red Sea coast.",
      "fullText": "OG TWT traveler. That should be a testimony within itself as to how amazing these trips TWT and Taliya provide. This Egypt trip was epic. I loved how much of Egypt we were able to see - from pyramids in Cairo, temples in Luxor, to seaside in Hurghada. This trip is not short on adventure. We rode camels, drove through the desert in ATVs, and sailed the Red Sea on a Yacht. The people here were super friendly and welcoming. Definitely have to try their shawarma and lentil soup. *chef's kiss* I am a solo traveler and very busy in my everyday life. Not only is it overwhelming to plan a trip aboard with places to go and things to do but it can be scary to travel across the world by yourself. However, with TWT I never feel uncomfortable or unsafe. I meet so many amazing people from different backgrounds from around the world. We come as strangers but always leave as lifelong friends. I love that all I have to do is pack my bags and meet in the lobby at \"x\" time and everything is taken care of. From airport transfers to excursions to restaurants. Everything is all planned out and very organized might I add.  Taliya is a wonderful host who is very thoughtful and has great energy. I will recommend her trips to anyone who will listen. You will not regret it!",
