      "fullText": "T World Tours really outdid themselves. I had never been on a group trip like this before. Having never met anyone in the group prior to the trip, you’d think I was crazy joining something like this. But honestly, I wish I had done this sooner. Taliya had everything handled from A to Z. Even with my incoming flight being suddenly delayed, Taliya still got my ride from the airport coordinated & was even able to upgrade my hotel room since I missed the first night of the trip. Also, she was very helpful with accommodating to my diet. I’m vegan so it can be sometimes challenging to eat at certain places but Taliya made it a priority to ensure I had an option at every restaurant. From the elephant sanctuary, to the hotel pool hangouts, to hiking, to the boat rides, to walking around Phi Phi islands, and to the yacht party, everything was planned seamlessly and I can’t wait for the next trip! Book the experience of a lifetime with T World Tours!",
