      "fullText": "10/10 — if I could be completely honest, this has been the best trip I have ever been on. Everything was so thoughtfully planned and beautifully put together.\n\nWhat meant the most to me was the connection. Coming in as complete strangers and leaving as sisters in Christ is something I will never forget. The sisterhood felt so genuine, so natural, and honestly, so needed.\n\nI’m already ready for another trip. Leaving made me emotional because for a moment, it felt like I had found a family — a group of women I could laugh with, have fun with, and truly be myself around.\n\nIf you’ve never traveled internationally before, let this be your sign. Step outside your comfort zone and just do it. You never know how much it might change you. If you ever thought about. wanting to join a sisterhood. Download the LTTA APP and get involved. And thank me later 😊\n\n-Vicky",
