      "fullText": "I honestly cannot say enough amazing things about traveling with T World Tours! Everything from the destinations to choose from, the thoughtful itinerary and diverse set activities planned, the professionalism across trip communication and coordination, as well as the positive energy and genuine connection with the people you meet - all of it is truly an unmatched experience.\n\nCape Town was my second trip with TWT (my first trip was to Brazil in November 2024) and it was incredible to say the least. There’s a reason that so many of us are returning travelers. Taliya (Founder and CEO of TWT) has really created and built such an amazing company and community of people who want to travel and see the world with experiences that offer a great balance of culture, connection, and luxury.\n\nOne trip is really all you need to want to experience traveling with TWT again and again.",
