      "fullText": "This was my first trip with TWT and will not be my last! I am the kind of person that does not venture out the country and for once I took the leap with TWT and I cannot tell you how happy I am with their services from beginning to end.\n\nRight off the airplane I was picked up by a very clean shuttle and the driver held up my name with a T World Tours sign. He drove me directly to the hotel where I was greeted by the amazing Hotel Staff who already had my check in information ready. The room and hotel was very nice, and they provided an amazing daily breakfast buffet that was to die for.\n\nThe itinerary every day was perfectly curated by T World Tours and the owner Taliya did an amazing job with the communication along the way. All the tours were awesome and I felt safe with every venture. Everyone on the trip got along and we became like family. Singing and dancing everywhere we went. What a great group of people! Strangers that now became friends!\n\nI cannot wait to do another tour with TWT! They took a person like me that was turning into homebody to someone that wants more adventures to see more of the world. South Africa was beautiful! Thank you TWT for an amazing experience from beginning to end.",
