      "fullText": "This is my second TWT trip and it did not disappoint, it continued to exceed my expectations! I have done Zanzibar and most recently Cape Town! TWT is full of luxury, laughter, and life long memories! The way Taliya plans the trips to give you the best mix of adventure, culture, nightlife, relaxation, etc. is chefs kiss! And I love that I don’t have to plan a single thing but what fly fits I’m going to wear on TWT trips. I can’t wait to plan my next 10 trips with TWT because there is no other way to travel but with T World Tours! Thank you for always leaving me smiling from ear to ear!",
