      "destinations": [
        "Cape Town"
      ],
      "summary": "A fifth TWT trip delivered organization, varied adventures, and lasting friendships.",
      "fullText": "This is my 5th trip with TWT. I have been loyal to this company for many reasons: (1) I do not need to plan the itinerary, I only need to show up, (2) everything is organized for me from transportation, accommodations, activities, etc, (3) the luxurious experiences, (4) meeting new people from around the world, and (5) TWT executes the experience with perfection! Traveling solo can be scary and overwhelming, but traveling with TWT makes the process easy. I have met so many amazing people from around the world with whom I have developed lasting friendships. We may start off as strangers, but by the 2nd day, it feels like I’ve known them my whole life.\n\nCape Town, South Africa was an amazing experience! We started off with an amazing welcome dinner that provided an immersive cultural experience through African dishes and entertainment. What a way to be welcomed into the Motherland. We then visited a luxurious safari, we tasted the finest wines South Africa had to offer, had adventurous fun sandboarding and riding ATVs, swam with the African penguins, played volleyball on the beach with the locals, and partied on a boat with an awesome DJ and champagne.\n\nOur host, Taliya (founder of TWT) was amazing! She is excellent with communication (especially if there are changes to the schedule), provides a list of activities or restaurants to try on our free time and just overall very sweet and thoughtful. She takes excellent care of her guests! Another added touch is that she provides a photographer who captures all these wonderful moments! I would highly recommend visiting Cape Town with TWT or signing up for any of her other trips. You won’t be disappointed. Not only will you have so much fun, but you will leave with lifelong friends and precious memories you will cherish for a lifetime.",
      "title": "Cape Town, South Africa"
