      "fullText": "My first trip with TWT to Cape Town—the Motherland—was nothing short of amazing. The booking process was seamless, and from the moment I arrived, I was met with a truly luxurious welcome. Every detail was intentional, from the personalized notes waiting in my hotel room to the thoughtfully curated itinerary.\n\nAny adjustments made to our schedule were communicated in a timely manner, which made the experience feel organized and stress-free. Taliya, the founder, went above and beyond to make me feel genuinely welcomed and part of the TWT family. By day two, the group no longer felt like strangers—it felt like a big family. This experience exceeded all expectations and set the standard for travel done right. I can’t wait to travel with TWT again.",
