      "summary": "Local knowledge and careful coordination supported a first Zanzibar group adventure.",
      "fullText": "where do I begin? I booked the Zanzibar group trip with TWT because I have always wanted to experience the culture of East Africa. I wasn't ready to travel alone so when I found this group trip, it was the perfect opportunity. After registering for the trip, I purchased my ticket and got to packing my bags. When traveling with TWT, you don't have to worry about much other than showing up.\n\n& let me tell you... this trip did NOT disappoint. The team at TWT makes sure to account for every last detail, making each excursion unforgettable. Being with a co-host that was native to Zanzibar and spoke Swahili, I felt safe throughout the entire trip. If you're looking to explore some of the most slept on but REMARKABLE places on the globe, hassle-free, I recommend a trip with TWT! These memories will live with me forever & I cannot wait to attend more trips. Thank you T World Tours for an experience of a lifetime <3",
