      "fullText": "This was my second trip with TWT, but my first time booking a private trip, and once again, they did not disappoint! I had the most amazing experience visiting Bali, from exploring hidden local gems to experiencing some of the island’s most popular tourist attractions. It was truly the perfect balance of adventure, culture, relaxation, and luxury.\n\nOne of the highlights of our trip was having a private driver throughout our stay. He was absolutely wonderful! He was always accommodating when we wanted to make changes to our itinerary, ensured we were comfortable, and most importantly, made sure we felt safe everywhere we went.\n\nTWT also kept the surprises coming! From our beautiful hotel accommodations to thoughtfully planned surprise dinner reservations, every detail made the experience feel that much more special. I loved being able to enjoy my vacation without having to worry about the planning and logistics.\n\nWhat I appreciate most about TWT is their ability to create memorable experiences while still allowing you the flexibility to enjoy your trip your way. Bali was truly unforgettable, and I couldn’t have asked for a better experience!\n\nTwo trips down with TWT, and I can confidently say there will be more! Highly recommend them to anyone looking for a beautifully curated travel experience!"
